        <headline>Small Craft Advisory issued September 24 at 2:13AM PDT until September 25 at 9:00PM PDT by NWS San Francisco CA</headline>
        <description>* WHAT...West winds 10 to 25 kt with gusts up to 35 kt expected.

* WHERE...Monterey Bay.

* WHEN...From 9 AM to 9 PM PDT Friday.

* IMPACTS...Conditions will be hazardous to small craft.
</description>
        <instruction>Inexperienced mariners, especially those operating smaller
vessels, should avoid navigating in hazardous conditions.</instruction>
